@startuml
title 批次提交与异步质量校验流程（含专用采集设备与移动采集）

participant Bank as "Bank\n(Core System / Teller App)"
participant Device as "Capture Device\n(Scanner / MICR / Mobile SDK)"
participant Clearing as "Clearing Hub"
participant QC as "Image QC / OCR Service"

== 采集与本地预检 ==
Bank -> Device : Place cheque / invoke capture
note right of Device: 1) Scan front/back (duplex)\n2) Read MICR (E13B/CMC7)\n3) Capture metadata (device_id, operator_id, dpi)\n4) Local QC: DPI/blur/edge detection\n5) Compute SHA-256 hash of images
Device --> Bank : Capture Result (images, micr, hash, qc_flags)

alt local QC failed
  Bank -> Bank : Operator prompt / re-scan / manual capture
  Bank -> Device : Re-scan / adjust settings
  Device --> Bank : New Capture Result
end

note left: Mobile capture path (optional)
Bank -> Device : (Mobile App) take photo
note right of Device: Mobile SDK does guide-overlay, perspective correction, live QC
Device --> Bank : Capture Result (images, ocr_preview, hash, qc_flags)

== 批次打包与提交 ==
Bank -> Bank : Package batch (batch_id, transactions[], images, metadata)
Bank -> Clearing : Capture Batch Submission\n(batch_id, transactions[], images, sig/hash)\nTransport: HTTPS/mTLS or SFTP+Manifest

Clearing -> Bank : Immediate Receipt ACK\n(receipt_id)  <<sync>>
activate Clearing

Clearing -> QC : enqueue for image validation\n(transaction_ids, image_refs)  <<async>>
note right of QC: Central OCR, DPI check, hash verify, OCR vs handwritten check

QC --> Clearing : Image Validation Detail\n(transaction_id, quality_score, ocr_amount, flags)  <<async>>
Clearing -> Clearing : update transaction status based on QC results

alt any transaction flagged/rejected
  Clearing -> Bank : Batch Processing Result (entries)\n(status=REJECTED, reject_code, reason)  <<async>>
  Bank -> Bank : operator/manual review or rescan (use original device or mobile)
  Bank -> Device : Re-scan / Retrieve original image / provide annotation
  Bank -> Clearing : Capture Batch Submission (resubmit)\n(new batch_id or same with correlation)  <<async>>
  Clearing -> Bank : Immediate Receipt ACK (for resubmit)
else all accepted
  Clearing -> Bank : Batch Processing Result (entries)\n(status=ACCEPTED)  <<async>>
end

deactivate Clearing
@enduml
